{"id":70076,"date":"2025-07-31T13:06:11","date_gmt":"2025-07-31T12:06:11","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=70076"},"modified":"2026-10-27T15:55:56","modified_gmt":"2026-10-27T14:55:56","slug":"farol-adventure-trail-flores-azores","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/farol-adventure-trail-flores-azores\/","title":{"rendered":"Farol Adventure Trail &#8211; Flores Azores 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Farol Adventure Trail - Flores Azores 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Farol Adventure Trail \u2013 Flores Azores 2027<\/strong> (4\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>17 de abril de 2027<\/strong>, no concelho das <strong>Lajes das Flores<\/strong>, na <strong>Ilha das Flores (A\u00e7ores)<\/strong>. Sob o conceito \u00fanico de ligar a ilha de farol a farol \u2014 desde o <strong>Farol do Albarnaz<\/strong> (Ponta Delgada) at\u00e9 \u00e0 meta comum no <strong>Farol da Ponta das Lajes<\/strong> \u2014, o evento prop\u00f5e-te uma travessia inesquec\u00edvel pelos antigos caminhos tradicionais entre freguesias e campos de cultivo.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Ao longo dos trilhos de p\u00e9 posto, ribeiras e desn\u00edveis acentuados, corres lado a lado com ex-l\u00edbris naturais da Reserva da Biosfera da UNESCO, como a <strong>Cascata do Po\u00e7o do Bacalhau<\/strong>, as <strong>Cascatas do Po\u00e7o do Ferreiro<\/strong> e o monumento geol\u00f3gico da <strong>Rocha dos Bord\u00f5es<\/strong>. Podes escolher entre o exigente <strong>FAT36 \u2013 Trail (36 km \/ 2301m D+)<\/strong> com partida \u00e0s 08:30 no Farol do Albarnaz, o <strong>FAT18 \u2013 Trail Sprint (18 km \/ 1007m D+)<\/strong> com partida \u00e0s 10:00 na Faj\u00e3zinha, ou o <strong>FAT09 \u2013 Trail Mini (9 km \/ 411m D+)<\/strong> e a <strong>Caminhada FAT09c (9 km)<\/strong> com partida \u00e0s 11:30 na Lomba.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pelo <strong>Atl\u00e9tico Clube Faj\u00e3 Grande<\/strong> em parceria com o <strong>Munic\u00edpio das Lajes das Flores<\/strong>, o evento \u00e9 certificado pela <strong>ITRA<\/strong>, <strong>UTMB Index<\/strong> e <strong>Federa\u00e7\u00e3o Portuguesa de Atletismo (FPA)<\/strong>, integrando ainda o Circuito de Trail de S\u00e3o Miguel e o Calend\u00e1rio Regional dos A\u00e7ores, com limite de 350 vagas e atividade complementar na vizinha <strong>Ilha do Corvo<\/strong> a 18 de abril.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">17 de Abril de 2027<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Farol da Ponta das Lajes (Meta), Lajes das Flores, A\u00e7ores<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-br