al<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/assets.acorrer.pt\/media\/10000\/6ab268cef3c65_Regulamento.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\">\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Abrir Regulamento Oficial (PDF) &rarr;\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li><div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas & Sub-eventos<\/strong><div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\"><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Longo<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">FAT36 \u2013 Trail (Farol do Albarnaz \u2192 Farol das Lajes)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 17 de Abril de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 08:30 \u2022 2301m D+<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 1:<\/strong> 27,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 15\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2:<\/strong> 32,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (16\/11 a 31\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 3:<\/strong> 37,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/01 a 28\/02\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Curto<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">FAT18 \u2013 Trail Sprint (Faj\u00e3zinha \u2192 Farol das Lajes)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 17 de Abril de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 10:00 \u2022 1007m D+<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 1:<\/strong> 22,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 15\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2:<\/strong> 27,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (16\/11 a 31\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 3:<\/strong> 32,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/01 a 28\/02\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Trail Curto<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">FAT09 \u2013 Trail Mini (Lomba \u2192 Farol das Lajes)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 17 de Abril de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 11:30 \u2022 411m D+<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 1:<\/strong> 17,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 15\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2:<\/strong> 22,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (16\/11 a 31\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 3:<\/strong> 27,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/01 a 28\/02\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Caminhada<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">FAT09c \u2013 Caminhada (Lomba \u2192 Farol das Lajes)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 17 de Abril de 2027 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 11:30 \u2022 411m D+<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 1:<\/strong> 17,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 15\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 2:<\/strong> 22,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (16\/11 a 31\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Fase 3:<\/strong> 27,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (01\/01 a 28\/02\/2027)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os hor\u00e1rios e locais de partida de cada prova do Farol Adventure Trail 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As provas realizam-se no s\u00e1bado, 17 de abril de 2027, todas com meta no Farol da Ponta das Lajes: o FAT36 (36 km \/ 2301m D+) parte \u00e0s 08:30 do Farol do Albarnaz (Ponta Delgada); o FAT18 (18 km \/ 1007m D+) parte \u00e0s 10:00 do Largo do Rossio (Faj\u00e3zinha); e o FAT09 (9 km \/ 411m D+) e a Caminhada FAT09c (9 km) partem \u00e0s 11:30 junto \u00e0 Igreja de S\u00e3o Caetano (Lomba). A organiza\u00e7\u00e3o disponibiliza transfers mediante reserva \u00e0s 06:45 (FAT36), 08:30 (FAT18) e 10:30 (FAT09\/Caminhada).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os e as fases de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o do Farol Adventure Trail 2027?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es dividem-se em 3 fases (Fase 1 at\u00e9 15\/11\/2026 | Fase 2 de 16\/11 a 31\/12\/2026 | Fase 3 de 01\/01 a 28\/02\/2027): o FAT36 custa 27\u20ac \/ 32\u20ac \/ 37\u20ac; o FAT18 custa 22\u20ac \/ 27\u20ac \/ 32\u20ac; e o FAT09 e a Caminhada custam 17\u20ac \/ 22\u20ac \/ 27\u20ac. O evento \u00e9 limitado a 350 vagas (120 no FAT36, 120 no FAT18, 60 no FAT09 e 50 na Caminhada).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">O que inclui o kit de participante e onde funciona o secretariado?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A inscri\u00e7\u00e3o inclui dorsal, t-shirt t\u00e9cnica da prova, abastecimentos l\u00edquidos e s\u00f3lidos, seguro desportivo, pr\u00e9mio finisher, transporte para a partida (mediante reserva), solo duro (mediante reserva), banhos no Pavilh\u00e3o Municipal e conv\u00edvio final. O secretariado funciona no Museu Municipal de Lajes das Flores na sexta-feira, 16 de abril, das 14:00 \u00e0s 16:30 e das 18:00 \u00e0s 20:00 (briefing \u00e0s 19:00).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite (cut-off) e o material obrigat\u00f3rio?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os tempos limite s\u00e3o de 8h00 para o FAT36, 6h00 para o FAT18, 3h30 para o FAT09 e 4h30 para a Caminhada (fecho da meta \u00e0s 16:30). \u00c9 obrigat\u00f3rio transportar dorsal vis\u00edvel, telem\u00f3vel funcional, apito e manta t\u00e9rmica em todas as provas, acrescendo dep\u00f3sito de \u00e1gua (m\u00ednimo 0,5 L) e imperme\u00e1vel nos percursos FAT36 e FAT18. Prepara a tua prova com o nosso guia de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/como-escolher-sapatilhas-trail\/\">sapatilhas de trail<\/a>.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quem organiza o Farol Adventure Trail \u2013 Flores Azores?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento \u00e9 organizado pelo Atl\u00e9tico Clube Faj\u00e3 Grande em conjunto com o Munic\u00edpio das Lajes das Flores, contando com certifica\u00e7\u00e3o ITRA, UTMB Index e FPA no calend\u00e1rio de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-acores\/\">corridas nos A\u00e7ores<\/a>.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Farol Adventure Trail - Flores Azores 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-04-17\", \"endDate\": \"2027-04-17\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Lajes das Flores, A\u00e7ores\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Lajes das Flores\", \"addressRegion\": \"A\u00e7ores\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O Farol Adventure Trail - Flores Azores 2027 realiza-se a 17 de abril nas Lajes das Flores (A\u00e7ores). Trails de 36 km, 18 km, 9 km e caminhada. Inscreve-te j\u00e1!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-farol-adventure-trail-flores-azores.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"FAT36 \u2013 Trail (Farol do Albarnaz \u2192 Farol das Lajes)\", \"price\": \"27.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/acorrer.pt\/eventos\/farol-adventure-trail-flores-azores-2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"FAT18 \u2013 Trail Sprint (Faj\u00e3zinha \u2192 Farol das Lajes)\", \"price\": \"22.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/acorrer.pt\/eventos\/farol-adventure-trail-flores-azores-2027\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"FAT09 \u2013 Trail Mini (Lomba \u2192 Farol das Lajes)\", \"price\": \"17.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"htt